#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:599
msgid ""
"Added :attr:`!name` and :attr:`!mode` attributes for compressed and archived "
"file-like objects in the :mod:`bz2`, :mod:`lzma`, :mod:`tarfile`, "
