"Add :c:type:`PyMutex`, a lightweight mutex that occupies a single byte, and "
"the new :c:func:`PyMutex_Lock` and :c:func:`PyMutex_Unlock` "
"functions. :c:func:`!PyMutex_Lock` will release the :term:`GIL` (if "
"currently held) if the operation needs to block. (Contributed by Sam Gross "
"in :gh:`108724`.)"
