#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2353
msgid ""
"Remove several functions, macros, variables, etc with names prefixed by "
"``_Py`` or ``_PY`` (which are considered private). If your project is "
"affected  by one of these removals and you believe that the removed API "
"should remain available, please :ref:`open a new issue <using-the-tracker>` "
"to request a public C API and add ``cc: @vstinner`` to the issue to notify "
"Victor Stinner. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`106320`.)"
msgstr ""
"Mehrere Funktionen, Makros, Variablen und Ähnliches mit dem Namenspräfix "
"``_Py`` oder ``_PY`` (die als privat gelten) sind entfernt. Ist dein Projekt "
"von einer dieser Entfernungen betroffen  und meinst du, die entfernte API "
"sollte weiter verfügbar sein, dann :ref:`eröffne bitte einen neuen Eintrag "
"<using-the-tracker>`, um eine öffentliche C-API zu beantragen, und ergänze "
"``cc: @vstinner``, um Victor Stinner zu benachrichtigen. (Beigetragen von "
"Victor Stinner in :gh:`106320`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2361
msgid ""
"Remove old buffer protocols deprecated in Python 3.0. "
"Use :ref:`bufferobjects` instead."
msgstr ""
"Die in Python 3.0 als veraltet markierten alten Puffer-Protokolle sind "
"entfernt. Verwende stattdessen :ref:`bufferobjects`."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2364
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyObject_CheckReadBuffer`: Use :c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer` to "
"test whether the object supports the buffer protocol. Note "
"that :c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer` doesn't guarantee "
"that :c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer` will succeed. To test if the object is "
"actually readable, see the next example of :c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer`."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyObject_CheckReadBuffer`: "
"Verwende :c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer`, um zu prüfen, ob das Objekt das "
"Puffer-Protokoll unterstützt. Beachte, dass :c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer` "
"nicht zusagt, dass :c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer` gelingt. Um zu prüfen, ob "
"das Objekt tatsächlich lesbar ist, siehe das folgende Beispiel "
"zu :c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer`."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2372
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyObject_AsCharBuffer`, :c:func:`!PyObject_AsReadBuffer`: "
"Use :c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer` and :c:func:`PyBuffer_Release` instead:"
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyObject_AsCharBuffer`, :c:func:`!PyObject_AsReadBuffer`: Verwende "
"stattdessen :c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer` und :c:func:`PyBuffer_Release`:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2375
msgid ""
"Py_buffer view;\n"
"if (PyObject_GetBuffer(obj, &view, PyBUF_SIMPLE) < 0) {\n"
"    return NULL;\n"
"}\n"
"// Use `view.buf` and `view.len` to read from the buffer.\n"
"// You may need to cast buf as `(const char*)view.buf`.\n"
"PyBuffer_Release(&view);"
msgstr ""
"Py_buffer view;\n"
"if (PyObject_GetBuffer(obj, &view, PyBUF_SIMPLE) < 0) {\n"
"    return NULL;\n"
"}\n"
"// Use `view.buf` and `view.len` to read from the buffer.\n"
"// You may need to cast buf as `(const char*)view.buf`.\n"
"PyBuffer_Release(&view);"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2385
